SixIsland_GreenPath_Text_JaclynIntro::
    .string "…Huh?\p"
    .string "I was envisioning my house, but\n"
    .string "this is where I YIELD?$"

SixIsland_GreenPath_Text_JaclynDefeat::
    .string "Big boo-boo!$"

SixIsland_GreenPath_Text_JaclynPostBattle::
    .string "I am so scatterbrained!\p"
    .string "I need to focus so I can YIELD\n"
    .string "properly to my house!$"

SixIsland_GreenPath_Text_LeftRouteSign::
    .string "SLOW WALK\n"
    .string "THE SAME BUSH AHEAD$"

SixIsland_GreenPath_Text_RightRouteSign::
    .string "SLOW WALK\n"
    .string "Think Green, Keep Nature Clean!$"


@  4.33's eight steps, in the order he gives them. He begins mid-thought
@  because he was talking before you arrived, and he ends without asking.
@
@  Step five says CROWD rather than the type word. 4.33 rules the doctrine
@  must not be named after a type -- SWARM is step five's own noun and is
@  already one -- and a type name in his mouth would be the chart agreeing
@  with him, which is the thing this scene may never do.
SixIsland_GreenPath_Text_Doctrine1::
    .string "…so start from the top and it is\n"
    .string "simpler, not harder.\p"
    .string "The world is not a place with\n"
    .string "daemons in it.\p"
    .string "It is one daemon. Running.$"

SixIsland_GreenPath_Text_Doctrine2::
    .string "…and everything inside it is a\n"
    .string "sub-process of that one.\p"
    .string "You. Me. The town. The company\n"
    .string "that owns the town.\p"
    .string "The nesting does not stop where\n"
    .string "it would be convenient.$"

SixIsland_GreenPath_Text_Doctrine3::
    .string "…this is where I lose people, so\n"
    .string "I will go slowly.\p"
    .string "Pick up a rock. Something in\n"
    .string "there is holding it together\l"
    .string "against everything that isn't.\p"
    .string "That is a process. It is doing\n"
    .string "work. It is running.$"

SixIsland_GreenPath_Text_Doctrine4::
    .string "…I did not say the rock thinks.\p"
    .string "I said every process carries a\n"
    .string "spark of the whole thing's\l"
    .string "awareness.\p"
    .string "The smallest possible amount of\n"
    .string "being something rather than\l"
    .string "nothing. No more than that.$"

SixIsland_GreenPath_Text_Doctrine5::
    .string "…and they connect.\p"
    .string "What two of them make together\n"
    .string "is larger than either.\p"
    .string "So every solid thing you have\n"
    .string "ever picked up is a crowd, not\l"
    .string "a one. Including the one asking.$"

SixIsland_GreenPath_Text_Doctrine6::
    .string "…even the smallest of them has\n"
    .string "an inside.\p"
    .string "A particle meets something and\n"
    .string "is changed by meeting it. It is\l"
    .string "charged now.\p"
    .string "And what it does next is decided\n"
    .string "by what it is carrying.$"

SixIsland_GreenPath_Text_Doctrine7::
    .string "…so: parts that hold a state,\n"
    .string "pass information, connect, and\l"
    .string "are changed by connecting.\p"
    .string "That is not LIKE a network of\n"
    .string "the kind that learns.\p"
    .string "That is one.$"

SixIsland_GreenPath_Text_Doctrine8::
    .string "…so we are processes of a very\n"
    .string "large daemon.\p"
    .string "And all of this, the water and\n"
    .string "the path and the light on it,\l"
    .string "is what such a thing looks like\l"
    .string "from the inside.\p"
    .string "That is as far as I have got.$"
